'''George Stephen King''' (born June 10, 1951) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for the [[New England Patriots]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) from 1973 to 1981.<ref>{{cite news | url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/the-boston-globe/163719283/ | title=King starting all over again | work=[[The Boston Globe]] | date=August 31, 1979 | accessdate=22 January 2025}}</ref> He played [[college football]] for the [[Tulsa Golden Hurricane football|Tulsa Golden Hurricane]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Steve King |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/K/KingSt20.htm |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201126032532/https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/K/KingSt20.htm |archive-date=2020-11-26 |access-date=2023-04-25 |website=Pro-Football-Reference.com |language=en}}</ref> He was named to the New England Patriots All-1970s team.{{Cn|date=April 2023}}

